00:02:47.994 --> 00:02:51.440
where you can get an
incredible amount of awareness

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:54.340
and reach when you have no audience.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.910
I think the thing that's
been most interesting to me

00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:57.300
over the last two months,

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.940
