is happening there,

00:03:05.965 --> 00:03:07.160
and I've been talking about it

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.040
quite a bit over the last hundred days,

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.810
I've been bombarded with emails and DM's

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:13.870
